@startuml UML_P3_Ranked_Elo_Update_Sequence

title Sequence Diagram - Game End & Elo Update

actor "User A" as UserA
participant "GameBoard" as Board
participant "GameService" as GS
participant "EloService" as Elo
participant "API" as API
database "DB" as DB
participant "NotificationService" as NS
actor "User B" as UserB

== Game End ==

UserA -> Board: Đi nước chiếu hết
activate Board

Board -> GS: makeMove(matchId, move)
activate GS

GS -> GS: validateMove(move)
GS -> GS: updateBoardState()
GS -> GS: checkGameEnd()

alt Checkmate / Người chơi đầu hàng
    
    GS -> GS: determineWinner()
    note right
      result = {
        winner: UserA,
        loser: UserB,
        reason: CHECKMATE
      }
    end note
    
else Hòa (Stalemate / Draw offer)
    
    GS -> GS: determineResult()
    note right
      result = {
        winner: null,
        reason: DRAW
      }
    end note
    
else AFK / Disconnect
    
    GS -> GS: forfeit(userId, reason)
    note right
      result = {
        winner: opponent,
        loser: userId,
        reason: FORFEIT_AFK
      }
    end note
    
end

== Update Elo ==

GS -> Elo: calculateEloChange(matchId, result)
activate Elo

Elo -> API: GET /api/users/rating
activate API

API -> DB: SELECT rating\nFROM user_ratings\nWHERE userId IN (userA, userB)
activate DB

DB --> API: {userA: 1500, userB: 1450}
deactivate DB

API --> Elo: Current ratings
deactivate API

Elo -> Elo: Calculate expected scores
note right
  Expected score formula:
  EA = 1 / (1 + 10^((RB-RA)/400))
  EB = 1 / (1 + 10^((RA-RB)/400))
  
  Example:
  RA = 1500, RB = 1450
  EA = 0.57, EB = 0.43
end note

Elo -> Elo: Calculate actual scores
note right
  Win = 1.0
  Draw = 0.5
  Loss = 0.0
  
  SA = 1.0 (UserA thắng)
  SB = 0.0 (UserB thua)
end note

Elo -> Elo: Calculate Elo changes
note right
  K-factor = 32 (for rated < 2400)
  
  ΔRA = K × (SA - EA)
      = 32 × (1.0 - 0.57)
      = 32 × 0.43 = +14
  
  ΔRB = K × (SB - EB)
      = 32 × (0.0 - 0.43)
      = 32 × (-0.43) = -14
  
  New ratings:
  RA_new = 1500 + 14 = 1514
  RB_new = 1450 - 14 = 1436
end note

Elo --> GS: {userA: +14, userB: -14}
deactivate Elo

== Save to Database ==

GS -> API: POST /api/ranked/match/{matchId}/complete
activate API

API -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB

API -> DB: UPDATE matches\nSET status='completed',\n    winner_id=userA,\n    end_time=NOW()\nWHERE matchId
DB --> API: OK

API -> DB: INSERT INTO elo_history\n(userId, matchId, oldRating,\n newRating, change, timestamp)
note right
  Ghi 2 bản ghi:
  - UserA: 1500 → 1514 (+14)
  - UserB: 1450 → 1436 (-14)
end note
DB --> API: OK

API -> DB: UPDATE user_ratings\nSET rating=CASE\n  WHEN userId=userA THEN 1514\n  WHEN userId=userB THEN 1436\nEND\nWHERE userId IN (userA, userB)
DB --> API: OK

API -> DB: UPDATE user_stats\nSET wins=wins+1\nWHERE userId=userA
DB --> API: OK

API -> DB: UPDATE user_stats\nSET losses=losses+1\nWHERE userId=userB
DB --> API: OK

API -> DB: COMMIT
deactivate DB

API --> GS: Update successful
deactivate API

== Notify Players ==

GS -> NS: notifyGameEnd(matchId, result)
activate NS

NS --> UserA: Game ended!\nYou won! (+14 Elo)\nNew rating: 1514
NS --> UserB: Game ended!\nYou lost (-14 Elo)\nNew rating: 1436
deactivate NS

GS --> Board: Game completed
deactivate GS

Board --> UserA: Hiển thị kết quả\nvà thay đổi Elo
deactivate Board

note over DB
  Tất cả thay đổi được thực hiện
  trong một transaction để đảm bảo
  tính nhất quán của dữ liệu
end note

@enduml
